  "content": {
    "id": "p22-q6-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "6",
    "prompt": "Consider the functions $f:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}$ and $g:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R}$ given by $f(x)=x^2+3x+2$ and $g(x)=x^2-3x+2$. Find the value(s) of $x$ for which:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$f(g(x))=6$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{3\\pm\\sqrt5}{2}$.\n\nSolve for $g(x)$ first; the branch $g(x)=-4$ has no real solutions.",
          "worked": "Let $u=g(x)$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}u^2+3u+2&=6\\\\u^2+3u-4&=0\\\\(u+4)(u-1)&=0\\end{align*}$$\n\nThus $g(x)=-4$ or $g(x)=1$.\n\nFor $g(x)=-4$:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2-3x+2&=-4\\\\x^2-3x+6&=0\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe discriminant is $9-24=-15$, so this branch has no real solutions.\n\nFor $g(x)=1$:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2-3x+2&=1\\\\x^2-3x+1&=0\\\\x&=\\frac{3\\pm\\sqrt{9-4}}{2}\\\\x&=\\frac{3\\pm\\sqrt5}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 70
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q6-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$g(f(x))=6$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{-3\\pm\\sqrt{17}}{2}$.\n\nSolve for $f(x)$ first; the branch $f(x)=-1$ has no real solutions.",
          "worked": "Let $u=f(x)$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}u^2-3u+2&=6\\\\u^2-3u-4&=0\\\\(u-4)(u+1)&=0\\end{align*}$$\n\nThus $f(x)=4$ or $f(x)=-1$.\n\nFor $f(x)=-1$:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+3x+2&=-1\\\\x^2+3x+3&=0\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe discriminant is $9-12=-3$, so this branch has no real solutions.\n\nFor $f(x)=4$:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+3x+2&=4\\\\x^2+3x-2&=0\\\\x&=\\frac{-3\\pm\\sqrt{9+8}}{2}\\\\x&=\\frac{-3\\pm\\sqrt{17}}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 70
      }
    ]
  },
